# Innap — Architecture Rules

Hotel admin (Resort API). TypeScript only (`.ts` / `.tsx`). No new `.js` / `.jsx`. Match UI via `ui-design-system` rule.

## Feature flow (required)

```
app/(dashboard)/<domain>/<feature>/page.tsx
  → container/<domain>/<feature>/index.tsx
      → Hooks.ts + *Apis.ts + types.ts (+ optional *Reducer.ts)
  → components/<domain>/<feature>/*.tsx
```

- **page**: metadata + mount container only
- **container**: load data, hooks, cookies; pass props
- **Hooks**: RHF + yup, API calls, Redux, business rules
- **Apis**: `doGetApiCall` / `doPostApiCall` / `doPutApiCall` / `doDeleteApiCall` + `endPoints` only
- **types.ts**: feature entity, form values, payloads (inside that container folder)
- **components**: UI only; `common/formFields` + `components/shared`

## Shared API / auth

- Base URL: `NEXT_PUBLIC_BASE_API_URL` → `utils/endPoints.ts` (never hardcode host)
- Auth: Bearer from cookie `resortToken` (`utils/apiConfig.ts`)
- Menus: live `GET /menus` via `container/layout/LayoutApis.ts` — no hardcoded sidebar demo data
- Shared wrappers only: `types/api.ts` (`ApiCudResponse`, `ApiListResponse`)

## Packages (do not swap stacks)

- Next App Router · React · TypeScript
- Tailwind 4 · RHF + yup · Redux Toolkit · axios · date-fns · react-hot-toast
- UI: `components/ui/*` · lucide-react / react-icons · recharts when needed

## New screen checklist

1. Thin `page.tsx`
2. `container/.../{index.tsx,Hooks.ts,*Apis.ts,types.ts}`
3. `components/...` (Toolbar, Table, FormDialog, DeleteDialog, index)
4. URLs in `utils/endPoints.ts`
5. Register reducer in `redux/configureStore.ts` if needed
6. PageShell + live API only (no demo/mock rows)

## Do not

- Demo/mock payloads or hardcoded menus/KPIs
- Business logic in `app/` pages or presentational components
- Duplicate `.js`/`.jsx` beside `.ts`/`.tsx`
- Commit `.env` / secrets
